<title>USA: Appliance Recycling not eyeing new units.</title>
<headline>Appliance Recycling not eyeing new units.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Appliance Recycling Centers of America Inc said Wednesday it plans to focus on improving performance of existing stores and does not expect a significant number of new store openings until at least the second quarter of 1997.</p>
<p>It said due to the closing of several underperforming Encore stores, the company ended the third quarter on September 28 with 26 stores, compared with 30 at the end of the second quarter.</p>
<p>Appliance Recycling is a recycler of major household appliances.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
